WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.670
General Jennie Carignan was appointed Chief of the Defence Staff on July 18th, 2024.

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:11.204
By October 2024, the Canadian Forces Aptitude Test was eliminated under her command.

00:00:11.204 --> 00:00:16.386
On February 19th, 2026, a foreign military recruit program was launched.

00:00:16.386 --> 00:00:30.090
By February 28th, 2026, Canadian Armed Forces strength stood at sixty-six thousand seven hundred and twenty-six against a target of seventy-one thousand five hundred — a shortfall of four thousand seven hundred and seventy-four.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:39.693
On April 12th, 2026, Sky News broadcast General Carignan stating she was building an armed public service force for anti-government civil unrest.

00:00:39.693 --> 00:00:44.079
The clip accumulated over two hundred and twenty-two thousand five hundred views.

00:00:44.079 --> 00:00:47.590
Three hundred thousand strategic reserve civilians were announced.

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:51.329
Seven to eight domestic deployments occurred in under twelve months.

00:00:51.329 --> 00:00:57.545
The Chief of the Defence Staff publicly admitted to constructing a domestic military force to suppress Canadian citizens.

00:00:57.545 --> 00:00:59.636
This is not interpretation.

00:00:59.636 --> 00:01:03.227
It is her own words, on camera, broadcast internationally.
